BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 527.52 Tm (Pricing is the first fault line. John Neufer refuses any flat fee schedule and prices every file on four variables:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 512.30 Tm (deal size, deal type, borrower constraints and time pressure. Neufer tells brokers to charge 'enough points to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 497.07 Tm (make it worth your time,' and to load more points onto small loans, because one point on $100,000 is only) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 481.85 Tm ($1,000 [uqs40-CCDSc @ 00:00:32]. Shane Walton of the Commercial Loan Broker Institute comes at it from) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 466.62 Tm (the other end. Stop staring at the point number and chase total commission dollars, because a clean $5) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 451.40 Tm (million deal at one point pays $50,000, while a riskier $500,000 bridge at three points pays only $15,000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 436.17 Tm ([7OHPVFeEmD4 @ 00:04:11]. Walton's way to grow is to move upstream once capacity is maxed out:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 420.95 Tm (larger loans and larger checks instead of more conversations [FnBYMtrQW9M @ 00:14:12]. Neufer's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 405.72 Tm (answer is a floor. Close two to five deals a month and clear at least $5,000 to $10,000 per deal, or ask what) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 390.50 Tm (the point is [uqs40-CCDSc @ 00:10:38]. Both playbooks share one discipline: every file has to justify the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 375.27 Tm (hours. They split on where the leverage lives. Neufer squeezes margin out of small, messy, rushed files,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 360.05 Tm (while Walton argues the cleaner, bigger, bankable file wins even at a fraction of the rate.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 344.82 Tm (Upfront money splits the camp. Walton's default line is that the broker typically gets paid only when the deal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 329.60 Tm (actually funds: 'not just for trying, only for closing the deal' [v3GnrXphwvM @ 00:01:57]. Yet the same) Tj ET
