BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 299.15 Tm (filter for tire kickers. The deposit is credited back against fees at closing. Softer operators drop it to $250 or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 283.92 Tm (add a refund clause that kicks in if no comparable LOI arrives within 45 days [7OHPVFeEmD4 @ 00:05:11].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 268.70 Tm (A harder version from the Institute's payout breakdown combines both: a $10,000 engagement fee to work) Tj ET
