BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 439.07 Tm (an error on their own credit report and seeing their score jump 100 points within days [jaczYsctbgs @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 423.85 Tm (00:11:12].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 408.62 Tm (Choosing the wrong lender is where months disappear. Hildebrandt counts roughly 1,700 SBA-approved) Tj ET
