BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 693.77 Tm (Every practitioner who works MCA files describes the same trap door. Once the advance funds, the funder) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 678.55 Tm (files a UCC filing. Sebastian Boore of The Approved Guy says that filing makes it very difficult to get a better) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 663.32 Tm (product, so the only offer left is another advance. He has seen up to seven positions stacked against one) Tj ET
