BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (second advance covers the gap the first one created, and then a third follows. Once combined withdrawals) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (hit thirty to forty percent of daily card receipts, most businesses cannot cover rent, payroll and inventory) Tj ET
