BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (off an old one. They read it as a sign of a repeated cash flow problem, not a short-term hiccup. They add) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (that stacking is a refinancing fact that pushes a court toward treating the deal as a loan [A8iNT8Ctrhk @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (00:07:10].) Tj ET
