BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (market all day to businesses that have good credit and no business taking an MCA. The pitch is that there is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (no interest rate, just a factor rate of 1.35 or 1.45, sometimes 1.25. The advance is 80 to 90 percent of the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (average monthly statement, repaid by daily or weekly debits over three to twelve months [8x-cfQhQpPU @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (00:01:25]. Zach Siegel of Small Biz Heroes adds that most brokers blowing up the phone sell only that one) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (product, and many hold no license. Their standard hook is: make payments for a month or two and you will) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (qualify for a line of credit. That line rarely shows up. The broker ghosts or offers one more short-term) Tj ET
