BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (one rule that separates winners from casualties. The advance has to be profit-based: take it only if it makes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (you money, and never to pay bills or survive [ORF9Ue9ge8A @ 00:06:23].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (Before any exit, the agreed first move is to stop adding positions. Siegel's rule: if you carry more than three) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (MCAs, take no new ones while the fix is underway, because every new position makes the business harder) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (to save. From that point the goal is fewer, cheaper and slower payments, not shorter, faster and more) Tj ET
