BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.35 Tm (consolidation into a new loan the fastest route. It takes 10 to 15 days, and up to 30 days of underwriting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.12 Tm (when a bank is involved. It only works if the owner clears the credit score and debt service coverage) Tj ET
