BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (advance. Factor rates run 1.14 to 1.45, with the average around 1.27 to 1.3. At 1.2, borrowing 100 dollars) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (costs a fixed 120, whether you pay early or not [ORF9Ue9ge8A @ 00:03:39]. Zoryn puts typical payback at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (6 to 13 months, averaging 6. Across the market terms span 3 to 24 months, and risky files sometimes get 1) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (month [ORF9Ue9ge8A @ 00:07:30]. Compressing the term drives the effective cost up fast. Charles Rubio) Tj ET
