BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (00:14:42]. Neil Goldstein, the CRO who appears on Corporate Bankruptcy A to Z, says most advances sit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (between 60 and 90 percent interest. Loans, by contrast, have to stay within usury limits [50wAPhzWGmY @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (00:04:42]. Zoryn's profit test runs on the same numbers. Borrow 100 at 1.2, earn 300 in margin after cost of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (goods, and keep 180, which he calls effectively free money. He has seen both outcomes in his own) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (high-end fashion company. Holiday inventory advances made a killing. Advances taken years later just to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (pay bills helped sink the business.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (Each refinance route comes with specific qualification numbers. Granados lists credit floors of 660-plus) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (FICO, 680-plus or 640-plus across all three consumer bureaus. He also wants a debt service coverage ratio) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (of preferably 1.25x, with 1.0 workable when other factors carry the file: average daily balances, NSFs,) Tj ET
