BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (higher: 700-plus credit, net profitability, time in business and securable assets. Below that bar he uses) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.35 Tm (asset-backed takeouts: business-use HELOCs on terms up to 30 years, receivables facilities or invoice) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.12 Tm (factoring, sale-leasebacks on equipment owned free and clear, and stacked unsecured five-year term loans) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 160.90 Tm (with a co-signer if needed [w-ETPb-Trek @ 00:07:10]. Boore's showcase file had five MCAs totaling over 1.5) Tj ET
